# tree128_nonblocking_400Gbps.topo
# Scale-out (inter-node) fabric for the 128-GPU realistic embedding: 128 hosts on a
# single non-blocking crossbar (Podsize==Nodes==Radix_Down => 1 ToR, every pair one
# hop, no oversubscription). Per-host 400 Gbps = NDR InfiniBand (one rail/GPU) — the
# rail-optimized, non-blocking design of a DGX-H100 SuperPOD Scalable Unit (non-
# blocking up to 256 GPUs). Carries the DP/PP traffic; -nodes must equal 128 hosts.
Nodes 128
Tiers 2
Podsize 128

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 400
Radix_Down 128
Radix_Up 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 100
Oversubscribed 128

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 400
Radix_Down 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 100
